  "summary_md": "**ServiceNow AI Research ([@ServiceNowRSRCH](https://x.com/ServiceNowRSRCH/status/2115851159282090235))** introduces **Apriel Voice 27B Preview**, an open-weight voice model that reasons across modalities and orchestrates multi-step tool calls; a speech encoder connects to a reasoning backbone via a learned projector, co-adapted with text replay and a frozen teacher. The thread reports EVA-A accuracy 51.3%, EVA-X 74% and τ3-Voice task completion 66%, with a live demo ([Apriel Live](https://servicenow-ai-apriel.hf.space/), [weights](https://huggingface.co/ServiceNow-AI/Apriel-Voice-27B-preview), [blog](https://servicenow-ai-apriel.hf.space/blog/apriel-voice-preview), [tech report](https://servicenow-ai-apriel.hf.space/documents/apriel-voice-preview-tech-report)).",
